#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-MD-rev-p.rst:5 9ea98907d2eb4d968d324d6478d7b45b
msgid "Modern Devices Wind Speed Sensor"
msgstr "Modern Devices 风速传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-MD-rev-p.rst:7 b7ab4cf6d6c741e3b1fa975ab5d79116
msgid ""
"A `Modern Devices wind sensor Rev. P "
"<https://www.moderndevice.com/product/wind-sensor-rev-p>`__ hot wire "
"anemometer can be used to sense the wind speed. This is selected by setting "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>` to 2."
msgstr ""
"`Modern Devices 风速传感器 Rev. P <https://www.moderndevice.com/product/wind-"
"sensor-rev-p>`__ 热线风速仪可用于感测风速。通过将 :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE <WNDVN_SPEED_TYPE>`"
" 设为2来选择此传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-MD-rev-p.rst:14
#: 48f9cebe7d2a4dfc81d5eab06deeed51
msgid ""
"This should be powered by between 10V and 12V and the OUT and TMP pins "
"connected to two 3.3V ADC pins. The speed output pin labeled OUT should "
"connected to the autopilot ADC pin defined by :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_PIN "
"<WNDVN_SPEED_PIN>`. The TMP pin of the sensor should be connected to the "
"autopilot ADC pin defined by :ref:`WNDVN_TEMP_PIN <WNDVN_TEMP_PIN>`. If only"
" a single ADC pin is available the TMP output may be omitted, "
":ref:`WNDVN_TEMP_PIN <WNDVN_TEMP_PIN>` should be set to -1 in this case. The"
" code will then assume room temperature; this will slightly reduce the "
"accuracy of the wind speed reading."
msgstr ""
"此传感器应由10V至12V供电，OUT 和 TMP 引脚连接到两个3.3V ADC 引脚。标记为 OUT 的速度输出引脚应连接到由 "
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_PIN <WNDVN_SPEED_PIN>` 定义的自动驾驶仪 ADC 引脚。传感器的 TMP 引脚应连接到由 "
":ref:`WNDVN_TEMP_PIN <WNDVN_TEMP_PIN>` 定义的自动驾驶仪 ADC 引脚。如果只有一个 ADC 引脚可用，可省略 "
"TMP 输出，此时 :ref:`WNDVN_TEMP_PIN <WNDVN_TEMP_PIN>` 应设为 "
"-1。代码将假设室温，这会略微降低风速读数的精度。"

#: ../../source/docs/wind-vane-MD-rev-p.rst:19
#: 0a2e5a18e0ff411a9cb4099ff40bbce8
msgid ""
"The :ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_OFS <WNDVN_SPEED_OFS>` should be set to the voltage "
"reading in zero wind. This calibration can be triggered automatically by "
"setting :ref:`WNDVN_CAL <WNDVN_CAL>` to 2. The vehicle must be disarmed and "
"the sensor sheltered from the wind. You will see a message in your GCS "
"reporting the updated offset voltage."
msgstr ""
":ref:`WNDVN_SPEED_OFS <WNDVN_SPEED_OFS>` 应设置为无风时的电压读数。此校准可通过将 "
":ref:`WNDVN_CAL <WNDVN_CAL>` 设为2来自动触发。车辆必须处于解锁状态且传感器须避风。您将在 GCS "
"中看到报告更新偏置电压的消息。"
